  - id: image_invisible_god
    displayName: The Image of the Invisible God
    flavorText: Christ is proclaimed as the image of the invisible God, by whom and
      for whom all things were created.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Establishes Christ's absolute supremacy over all creation, all authorities
      and powers, and the church, directly countering the false teaching's tendency
      to rank Christ alongside lesser spiritual powers or angelic mediators.
