  - id: philosophy_vain_deceit
    displayName: Philosophy and Vain Deceit
    flavorText: Paul warns the church against being led captive by hollow philosophy,
      declaring them already complete in Christ.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "The epistle's central corrective \u2014 warns against a syncretistic
      false teaching combining human philosophy, Jewish ceremonial regulation, and
      angel-worship/ascetic self-denial, insisting believers are already spiritually
      complete in Christ alone."
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_colossians
    managerId: philosophy_vain_deceit_col
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
