  - id: new_man
    displayName: The New Man
    flavorText: Believers are called to put off the old man and put on the new, clothed
      in compassion, kindness, and above all, love.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "Applies the doctrine of union with Christ practically \u2014 putting
      to death earthly/sinful practices, putting on Christlike virtue, dissolving
      ethnic and social distinctions in Christ, and ordering corporate worship."
    deliveredByManagerId: paul_colossians
    managerId: new_man_col
