    displayName: The Household Order
    flavorText: Paul orders wives, husbands, children, servants, and masters under
      the lordship of Christ.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "Reorders household relationships of authority \u2014 wives and husbands,
      children and fathers, servants and masters \u2014 under the lordship of Christ,
